{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "71890aa85325de75adbc70b25d0270f5c8a45e720f1d348cbcc688733a0c2d4f", "ja": "移ろう季節", "zh": "更迭的季节", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2bb929ee179d0917d4156f87ff86d14c1bdde8f2ab1288b26b3146f6194cb98a", "ja": "学園が珍しく賑やかさに包まれている事を\n不思議に思う昴。可憐から、皆生徒会選挙で\n誰を応援するか夢中なのだと教えてもらう。\n可憐とは交流を深められているが、千早に\nクッキーを渡せなかったことを言えない昴。", "zh": "学园罕见地笼罩在一片热闹之中，\n昴对此感到十分不可思议。可怜告诉她，大家正全神贯注于\n要在学生会选举中支持谁。\n虽然昴与可怜加深了交流，但她却说不出口\n自己没能把曲奇送给千早的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1000_101kot", "source_sha256": "8ff52ba9882800711266a3fb43d7fc4d5bc981d5d933cc930d609dd889ccb8d3", "ja": "楚々とした挨拶が、朝露を乗せた葉を揺らす。\nここは乙女たちの集う名門『聖ミリオン女学園』……。", "zh": "清雅的问候声，拂动了叶片上的朝露。\n这里是少女们汇聚的名门『圣百万女学园』……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1001_101kot", "source_sha256": "9617a38728f4081e525b94a3d806d5e154a7fef08aa6e697b5176abb02b84d31", "ja": "学び舎で気品を育み、庭園にて優美に歌う。日々を\n謳歌するため、今日も乙女たちは門をくぐるのです。", "zh": "在校舍中培育高雅，在庭园里优美歌唱。为了\n讴歌每一天，少女们今天也跨入了校门。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "ab1d0a47095d3e2687f0e0948ee6ff7a5e6ddcf8239c75487367b4e0e15a9011", "ja": "昴さん、この前はクッキーをありがとう。\nとっても美味しかったわ。", "zh": "昴，上次谢谢你送的饼干。\n真的非常好吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "044fe0ad03da56fd5058b7ed8875e404d93c1fd4bd38e1a777f8cba2651f2093", "ja": "わぁっ、本当ですか？\n可憐さんに褒めてもらえるなんて、うれしいな……♪", "zh": "哇，真的吗？\n能得到可怜的夸奖，真开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "7e5ef9174c52c1cf6fc069e4bd81ddf4c64cef0263f26d97c843c18f0aed2516", "ja": "本当よ。\n千早も、褒めてくれたでしょう？", "zh": "真的哦。\n千早也夸过你吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "bb62c3d17d7737b604fc9a74f09f722fab96a510556ed22e81843514bde4cff8", "ja": "え？\nあ、えっと……そうですね！", "zh": "诶？\n啊，这个嘛……是啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "8ec44a7bf0ea97241d7caa4f1b4ef5b1d2daaef7dec208ea57245621eff9a1da", "ja": "（……可憐さんに、ウソついちゃった。\n本当は、千早さんには渡せなかったのに）", "zh": "（……虽然很不甘心，但很开心）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1007_students", "source_sha256": "dcc194c3325d3dd77443c8ecf64ba74e8df05f9e6733c977fd7e8b1c751dc1e8", "ja": "ガヤガヤ……\nガヤガヤ……", "zh": "嘈杂声……\n嘈杂声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "462469f5cade502cabade47d69fb6070e53837d5b2f77ccaa5fdac2e7a81b4f9", "ja": "……？　なんだか、校内が騒がしいですね。\n何かあったのかな。", "zh": "……？总觉得学校里闹哄哄的呢。\n是出了什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "9f860dc33aaaf2a6ed76b5dd7a504b959c9c37ef5bf3151028c2c39e81ac1137", "ja": "生徒会選挙が控えているからかしら。みんな、\nどなたを応援するかということに夢中なのよ。", "zh": "也许是因为学生会选举就要开始了吧。大家都在热衷于支持哪位候选人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "d45a7ab0e2c5a83572dbd59984f9f9ed39066e9a7b8097be2655a0e5ffcb1a9f", "ja": "応援する候補が違うと、普段は仲のいいお友達同士が、\n対立してしまったりすることもあるから……。", "zh": "支持的候选人不同的话，平时关系很好的朋友之间，\n有时也会陷入对立……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "5f5701c1d5f51c6ac4ddc8b12b3804927cdf16edd1024fb8b1bde61e1e969905", "ja": "えっ……。それじゃ、応援する人が違ったら、\nもう友達とは仲良くできないんですか？", "zh": "诶……那如果支持的人不同，就再也没法和朋友好好相处了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "1ad0fa79815bdfec712237b7bb7a16f0ffb19a6f1b2c22d2330b94f4e534c343", "ja": "いいえ、そんなことはないわ。たとえ応援する人が\n違ったとしても、普段どおり仲良くしていいのよ。", "zh": "不是的，没有那回事哦。哪怕支持的人\n不一样，也完全可以像平时那样好好相处的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "650a89673cdbdfa01512e84d685c4c8ad866dc9b669bfad70afc633afd57a58a", "ja": "それが、『違う』ということだから。\n貴女と私は違う。ただそれだけなのよ。", "zh": "因为那就是所谓的“不同”。\n你和我是不一样的，仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "fac1ec02eebe7a67abd22fe33a5eab1e023bcd02cc2324532dce360862685d0d", "ja": "そう、ですよね。\nよかった……！", "zh": "是啊，就是这样。\n太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "1b926b7c92c36d56c2cb4f1f8353b3cfc0143ba3f14e40124df5d1fdcd24c135", "ja": "あの。可憐さんは、生徒会長になろうとか、\nそういうのはなかったんですか？", "zh": "那个，您之前没有想过要当学生会长之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "74ee410f31044634c592d64b7bf61f736278537ebde96086a5fe75323acdb5de", "ja": "ええ。だって生徒会長なら、\nみんなを平等に扱わなくてはでしょう？", "zh": "嗯。因为如果是学生会长，就必须平等地对待大家吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "a0d49bad2f421a44a668797a8b61ae303e555cd1494c088f43887028f319e7be", "ja": "それはきっと、私には難しいわ。\n私、依怙贔屓してしまうほうなの。ふふ。", "zh": "那对我来说一定很难。我比较容易偏心。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "b6cd5347e3a476e348af989e9be898c223dbfdaf2c55ec79b5a09dcbf282a020", "ja": "そんな。\n可憐さん、すごく優しいのに……。", "zh": "怎么会。\n可怜明明那么温柔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "b1ffbefa1a22bf1c647d4d0d47fc6f1d75f927a7a3c5f244edb0491d0f81589a", "ja": "ありがとう。でも私にとっては、昴さんが特別だから。\n……だから、こうしていられるのよ。", "zh": "谢谢你。不过对我来说，昴是特别的。\n……正因为这样，我才能像现在这样陪伴你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_01_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "bbd5b4c5ba5869888aa13245f3e915a9deca96345e8b6d6859269c13da5aee37", "ja": "大切な妹の、妹。\nそれはとっても、素敵なことなのよ。", "zh": "最宝贵的妹妹的，妹妹。\n那可是非常非常美好的事哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
